{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_undefined_vs_missing", "label": "undefined versus missing key", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "!== undefined, ?., and ?? cannot tell a present undefined from absence. PATCH/options need Object.hasOwn. JSON.stringify drops undefined, so the wire distinction is present-vs-absent or null-vs-absent."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_nullish_coalescing", "label": "Nullish coalescing ?? versus ||", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "?? falls back only on null/undefined so retries: 0 survives; || treats every falsy as missing. Mixing ?? with || or && is a SyntaxError without parentheses."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_array_holes", "label": "Array holes three states", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Present value, present undefined, and a hole all read as undefined. Only in/Object.hasOwn distinguish them. map/forEach skip holes; spread and for...of visit them as undefined."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_brand_check", "label": "Private field brand check", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ES2022 #field in obj asks whether this class constructed the object. Unforgeable unlike instanceof (Symbol.hasInstance, reassigned prototype, cross-realm). Legal only inside the declaring class; avoids try/catch TypeError on undeclared privates."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_undefined_vs_missing", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_in_and_hasown_object_hasown", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_undefined_vs_missing", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_nullish_coalescing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/existence-checks-and-delete/undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_existence_checks_and_delete_undefined_holes_an